            "text": "<ul><li><a href=\"https://shop.verselets.com/collections/singles\"><strong>Verselets Singles</strong></a><strong>:</strong> Wearable Scripture she can carry everywhere, a quiet reminder of God's Word right on her wrist.</li><li><a href=\"https://www.bellabeemade.com/product-page/butterflies-and-moths\"><strong>Bella Bee Made Butterfly Print</strong></a><strong>:</strong> A delicate print that celebrates transformation, perfect for the woman stepping into a new season. P.S. the sweet girl who designs our emails is the talented artist behind this beautiful print!</li><li><a href=\"https://gorings.com/\"><strong>Go Rings</strong></a><strong>:</strong> A meaningful ring with a mission, supporting ministry and fundraising partnerships with every purchase.</li><li><a href=\"https://www.joshgarrels.com/store/p/home-vinyl-lp\"><strong>Josh Garrels </strong><em><strong>Home</strong></em><strong> Vinyl LP</strong></a><strong>:</strong> Soulful, worshipful music made for slow evenings, spinning records and finding rest.</li><li><a href=\"https://elevatedfaith.com/collections/new-arrivals/products/cross-pendant-link-necklace\"><strong>Elevated Faith Cross Pendant Link Necklace</strong></a><strong>:</strong> A fresh take on the classic cross necklace, made for the woman who wants her faith to feel both timeless and modern.</li><li><a href=\"https://carissagraceart.com/prints/a-new-thing-illustrated-gicle-print-tztgw-35ecx\"><strong>Carissa Grace \"A New Thing\" Print</strong></a><strong>:</strong> A beautifully illustrated reminder from a Charlotte artist that God is always making all things new.</li><li><a href=\"https://www.patsyshaw.com/prints\"><strong>Patsy Shaw Prints</strong></a><strong>:</strong> Original artwork that brings warmth and beauty to any wall, a gift she'll enjoy every day.</li></ul>",
